        "generation drift is flagged against db_meta",
        "tampered snapshots are dropped — they never become recovery points"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Restore",
      "items": [
        "make snapshot-restore, then reconnect query parity is proven",
